Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼和不良少年们一起抢卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）别再和鲨鱼扯上关系了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是那样的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是为了鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是也是我自己的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我一定要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 让鲨鱼清醒过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）小心点游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 有什么不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予其攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）这就是我们的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火山恐龙的力 岩浆克斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去可不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）但是这样一来，火山恐龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材已经用完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.39,0:00:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果岩浆Max已经不能再用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，胜负现在才要开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！什么现在才开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先拿凌牙你开刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用攻击力2500的火山恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对凌牙直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宙斯之息！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效1只怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切，居然盖了那种卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～得救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的场地可是空无一物。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一回合就解决你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥布林德伯格！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哥布林德伯格）库库库库。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把1只等级4以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.85,0:01:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:02:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤等级4的隆隆隆魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的怪兽有2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的隆隆隆魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥布林德伯格叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙 结果还不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠 No.卡嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王／海王）嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来了啊 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是一直在等这家伙呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 雪崩 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）这张卡发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被召唤的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普被冻住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若使用怪兽效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那名玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将受到５００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 就用不了霍普的效果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量专用陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是粗心大意的召唤啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要封住 No.就是我的天下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气解决你。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻守变更。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将碎冰企鹅改为攻击表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}致命一击了，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用碎冰企鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对凌牙直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去死吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动希望皇霍普的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效一只怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了雪崩的效果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要承受500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过我们是同伴吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼　吃我这招　雪崩的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜　哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！　唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到　游马那家伙　为了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护鲨鱼召唤了霍普吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔　那家伙　多管闲事！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）美丽的友情游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了呢　交到了好同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就　再来一发让你尝尝！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用　飞机头·暴雪龙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对凌牙直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.51,0:06:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…　可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就这么睡着也没关系哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是稍微休息一下而已！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负现在才要开始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，看来你还没搞明白啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没明白我们的强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动，沃鲁卡修！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我通过这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将海王的怪兽 背头暴风雪龙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:06:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？为什么要特意把同伴的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改成守备表示？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了老哥，哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏如此，我可以从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}待机之冰洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只守备怪兽的等级提升1级。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）我将背头暴风雪龙的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从４升到５！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级５的怪兽有２只！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}我将　等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}级{\fnYusei Magic}５的明奇・冰山大帝和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}背{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}头{\fnYusei Magic}・暴雪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}龙进{\fnYusei Magic}行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}叠{\fnYusei Magic}放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　No.１９！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冰冻龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（冰冻龙）咕嘎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第二只 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动　冰冻龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用１个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将同伴的怪兽超量的叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单元复活？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（伏尔卡）咕嘎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔　叠放单元回来了也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来又能　用岩浆克斯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！在组队决斗里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能赢我们的家伙，根本不存在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，有哪里不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是作弊吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作弊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？你在说什么？哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别装傻！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然耍这种卑鄙的作弊手段！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？你说的那个伊萨萨卡是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是作弊！就是耍花招啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:09:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍花招？也就是说，他们在决斗中作弊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事，只有卑鄙的家伙才干得出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙从一开始就记住了彼此的卡组里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么卡以什么顺序
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放着的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连决斗盘的自动洗牌功能也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动了手脚吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此　所以那个时候也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的手牌里都正好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级5的怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用陷阱卡特意把同伴的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用魔法卡提升怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行超量召唤也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为双方都知道对方手里有什么卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也知道下一张要抽的卡是什么，对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话他们根本不配当决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正经的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会干这种出老千的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么出老千！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别血口喷人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出老千的人　是你才对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你在全国大赛上出的老千啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）什么夺冠热门啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决赛的休息室里偷看对手卡组的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗怪兽 全国大赛也
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于迎来了决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺冠热门神代凌牙选手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正顺利推进着赛程。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢。我必须非赢不可。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟会展开一场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎样的决斗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙的卡组！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（观众们）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 凌牙！ 凌牙 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于决赛的决斗也迎来高潮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能赢！ 就差一点了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哟 在这里盖下一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《盖牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.45,0:10:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 在这个局面下要出的话那张卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就能赢！》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（蜂鸣音）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本次决斗，因存在违规行为
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙选手将被取消资格。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代选手因不正当
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查看了对手的卡组……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此原因你被从决斗的正式舞台上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永久驱逐了！啊哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我害怕输。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～哈哈哈！夺冠热门
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然害怕输啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真丢人。是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）真是个没出息的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么好笑的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为害怕输有什么好笑的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也害怕啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在觉得会输的那一瞬间突然就害怕起来了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才用了 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么是为了救鲨鱼虽然嘴上这么说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实是我害怕输啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我撒了谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但正因为这样我才觉得。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独决斗，我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也不想撒谎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼也一定是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以鲨鱼的决斗才是货真价实的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管对手用什么卑鄙手段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们都要堂堂正正地战斗并获胜！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们现在的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，说得倒好听。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的场上只有一只被冻住的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这个能干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我们要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 超量礼物！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.89,0:12:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 针曼波鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡 浮上！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.71,0:13:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从自己的墓地将1只水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以表侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的针曼波鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大鲨鱼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.01,0:13:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动黑鳍枪兵的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将火山恐龙的怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效到结束阶段！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就能打倒 No.怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是攻击力是火山恐龙更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了 陆王。发动针曼波鱼的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡被送入墓地的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火山恐龙的攻击力下降500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2000！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑鳍枪兵的攻击力超过了它。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能逆转那个局面……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用黑鳍枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击火山恐龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！黑枪刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！陷阱发动！代偿交换！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡将战斗无效，作为代替{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家受到相当于火山恐龙攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙，替它挡下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来进攻，海王来防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的战斗方式！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！火山深渊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当同伴受到效果伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认对方的手牌，如果有怪兽卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那卡回到卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要确认你的手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了不让你召唤怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《隆隆隆石人和死者苏生…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《死者苏生…哼，那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不是能运用自如的卡》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！把怪兽卡回到卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…隆隆隆石人竟然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王的笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你们也完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先从凌牙你开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动火山恐龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方一只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予其攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 给予攻击力数值 ２１００点的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害 给凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！岩浆魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！伤害节食！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 效果伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以火山恐龙为对象 发动陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仇恨冰隙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 自己的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卡的效果破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手１只怪兽一起拖下水
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然想跟我同归于尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 强制转移！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将陷阱的对象 变更为冷冻龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！ 打倒海王了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙 竟敢对我弟弟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别以为从这里能白白回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动火山恐龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！岩浆克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）呜嗷～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害节食！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍小聪明！用火山恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对凌牙直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡 最后委托！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以强制结束战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 从自己的手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张卡交给对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？给我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家 我也可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那张卡是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 双火山！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡　在自己回合的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准备阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予500点伤害　并且
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再给予500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？　也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错　只要那家伙的回合到来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两人的生命值都会归零。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　就是我们赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）哈哈哈！　做好觉悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.01,0:17:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们还有　胜机！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的胜机……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是你的话　应该能察觉到》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《你能明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他心中所想……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《现在　我能做的就是用死者苏生把　霍普……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 装甲超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼给我的卡… 这样啊！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死者苏生也可以从对方的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽复活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要特殊召唤霍普吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从鲨鱼的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤黑鳍枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（黑鳍枪兵）哦哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼哈哈。 为什么要召唤攻击力那么低的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑鳍枪兵啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是个门外汉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装甲超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装甲超量？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量专用卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以装备在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己墓地里的怪兽超量1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的怪兽1只上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍～普。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将希望皇霍普装备到黑雷枪兵上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼就算攻击力变成2500{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.不是 No.的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就击不倒，你忘了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是能击倒啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雷枪兵通过装甲超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被当作霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说能变成拟似的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拟似的 No.？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，火山恐龙它。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，黑雷枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击火山恐龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.19,0:19:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，装甲超量通过将装备的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普送去墓地……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让黑鳍枪兵的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次成为可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将霍普送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，黑鳍枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对陆王直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑枪刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔～。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果 其12。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你们的决斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们刚才在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要偷卡啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快逃。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再回来了！ 呸～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉。 我 对你撒了谎。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原谅我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 那个 那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事了 已经。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个 不来场决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.97,0:21:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就来？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 鲨鱼。 呃 那个 对了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装甲超量 这个还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你了 那张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你稍微有点长进了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 菜鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.53,0:22:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡是从手牌？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是 盖放之后？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.65,0:24:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是 盖放之后哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.78,0:24:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要设置陷阱是需要准备的。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在发动之前必须先盖放才行。

